/*
  Authentication Process:
  1. User: Email + Password
  2. Server: Validate Credentials (Database Check -> Password has compare): Authenticated / Rejected
  3. Claim: If Authenticated: Create Claims (Basic Informaiton Of User)
    {
      UserId: 1,
      Email: "user@emial.com"
      Role: "Admin"
    }
  4. ClaimIdentity: Create ClaimIdentity Object (Holds Claims + Authentication Type)
  5. Claim Principal: Create Principal Object (Holds One or More ClaimIdentity)
  6. Sign-In: Sign-In User (Cookie / JWT Token) HttpContext

  Authorization Process:

  ASP.NET Identity

  1. User Table
  2. Password Hashing
  3. Role
  4. Claim
  ..
  ..
  ..



*/
